WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:04.300
♪♪

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.667
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.734
Today is Halloween,

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:10.701
so if you like jump scares,
ghouls, and goblins,

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.300
then you just have to wait
eight more days.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.067
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.400
Until that.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:22.400
President Biden early voted
over the weekend in Delaware

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.167
because people his age
do everything early.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:29.534
Voting two weeks before
the election, dinner at 4:30.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:32.868
Hell, his luggage is already
packed for Christmas vacation.

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:34.534
[ Light laughter ]
That's right.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.267
President Biden voted
over the weekend,

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.634
and in the interest
of bipartisanship,

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.067
he voted for everyone.

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:41.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.334
"I like them all.
They're all good fellas."

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.234
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.701
Tesla's CEO Elon Musk last week

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:51.167
completed the $44 billion deal
to take control of Twitter.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:53.167
And meanwhile, a lot
of his customers are still

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:55.501
trying to take control
of their Teslas.

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:57.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.501 --> 00:01:00.067
After completing the purchase of
Twitter on Thursday,

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:01.868
Elon Musk sent a tweet directed

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:03.567
at the social media company's
advertisers

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.100
and said the platform

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.801
"obviously cannot become
a free-for-all hellscape."

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.133
No, but it could stay that.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:13.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.434
During last week's
Pennsylvania Senate debate,

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:17.634
Republican candidate
Dr. Mehmet Oz said

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:20.100
that he thought the decisions
about abortion

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.801
should be left up to
"women, doctors,

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.033
local political leaders."

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.067
Though to be fair,
in some cases,

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:29.067
that local political leader
may be the father.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:32.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.534
Just statistically...

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:38.400
President Biden is reportedly
considering a plan to

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.100
use Guantanamo Bay
to house Haitian migrants.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.901
Unfortunately
he's going to have to wait

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:45.234
another few days
to move them in.

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:48.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.834
And finally, yesterday was
National Candy Corn Day,

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:53.367
which makes today national

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:55.801
"there's still plenty
of candy corn day."

00:01:56.968 --> 00:02:00.501
There is only one week left
until the midterms.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:03.901
Said Biden,
"Um, cocaine is legal?"

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:09.868
President Biden
yesterday suggested a tax on

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:12.767
oil and gas companies if they do
not increase production,

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:15.400
because if anyone's concerned
about energy prices,

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:20.234
it's the guy who probably keeps
the thermostat at 78.

00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:22.901
New York governor Kathy Hochul
is set to hold a rally

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:24.834
on Thursday with
Hillary Clinton.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.801
"Are you sure
that's a good idea?",

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:30.067
said Hillary Clinton.

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.868
President Biden spoke today
in Florida about

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.067
the importance of
Social Security and Medicare,

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:36.367
while Republicans
promised seniors

00:02:36.367 --> 00:02:39.667
they'd just give them
that pool from "Cocoon."

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:50.334
A very, very fresh reference to
the film "Cocoon."

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:54.033
The New York City Council
last week

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:56.667
passed the so-called
Rat Action Plan

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:58.200
that aims to reduce
the number of rodents

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.634
within the five boroughs.

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:02.501
I guess they didn't have any
luck with their previous plan

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:06.834
of piling as much garbage
on the sidewalk as possible.

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:09.534
Come on, guys!

00:03:09.534 --> 00:03:11.133
Whose plan was that?

00:03:11.133 --> 00:03:12.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.968 --> 00:03:15.601
Was -- Be honest.

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.968
Did a rat give you that plan?

00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:20.834
"Uh...

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:23.701
he was a little fella."

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:25.868
CDC director
Dr. Rochelle Walensky,

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:27.267
over the weekend,
tested positive again

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:28.601
for the coronavirus.

00:03:28.601 --> 00:03:33.400
So, as per CDC recommendations,
she's taking a half-day.

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:37.067
In a recent interview,
singer Kid Rock said that

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:38.501
he would like to
have a beer with

00:03:38.501 --> 00:03:40.067
former president Barack Obama

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:42.834
despite not liking
his policies or voting for him.

00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:45.567
In fact, Barack Obama doesn't
even need to be there.

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:48.200
He'll just take
that beer, please.

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:52.601
Utah Senator Mitt Romney
posted a picture yesterday

00:03:52.601 --> 00:03:56.467
on Twitter of himself
dressed as Mario for Halloween,

00:03:56.467 --> 00:03:58.701
because the scariest thing
he could think of

00:03:58.701 --> 00:04:02.634
is a foreigner
taking our plumbing jobs.

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:06.601
A man in South Africa recently
broke a Guinness World Record

00:04:06.601 --> 00:04:10.067
by doing 19 consecutive
backbends in one minute.

00:04:10.067 --> 00:04:12.534
Said the man, "Uh, right, yeah,
setting a world record.

00:04:12.534 --> 00:04:14.901
Uh, yeah, that's what
I was trying to do."

00:04:14.901 --> 00:04:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:24.400
If you're wondering
what that joke means,

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.934
Mike Scollins wrote it.

00:04:26.934 --> 00:04:29.467
Just work backwards from that.

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:36.167
And, finally,
Netflix's ad-supported plan

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:39.234
will launch this week
for just under $7 a month,

00:04:39.234 --> 00:04:41.501
though it will be
free for everyone on

00:04:41.501 --> 00:04:44.234
the dad-supported plan.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.834
Somehow, that's a dad joke
at the same time.

00:04:47.834 --> 00:04:51.567
"Are you still
on my dad-supported?"

00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:56.033
Literally, like, what my dad
would call me up and say.

00:04:56.033 --> 00:04:59.300
"You know they're
doing ad-supported.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.601
Not you, though.
You're on the dad-supported."

00:05:02.901 --> 00:05:06.300
President Biden criticized
the GOP yesterday and said,

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.501
"This ain't your father's
Republican Party."

00:05:09.501 --> 00:05:13.133
Yeah, this one definitely feels
more like your uncle's.

00:05:13.133 --> 00:05:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.634 --> 00:05:17.734
President Biden also said
that next week's midterms are

00:05:17.734 --> 00:05:19.801
the "most important election
of our lifetime,"

00:05:19.801 --> 00:05:22.801
and that's saying something,
coming from a guy who, maybe,

00:05:22.801 --> 00:05:23.968
voted for Lincoln?

00:05:23.968 --> 00:05:26.133
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:27.767
President Biden warned yesterday

00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:29.767
that Republican
Senator Rick Scott wants

00:05:29.767 --> 00:05:32.601
to cut Social Security
and Medicare, and added,

00:05:32.601 --> 00:05:34.334
"Hot damn, boy!"

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:37.133
By the way, using the phrase
"Hot damn, boy,"

00:05:37.133 --> 00:05:39.634
instantly qualifies you
for Medicare.

00:05:39.634 --> 00:05:41.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:41.367 --> 00:05:44.501
At a campaign stop in Wisconsin,
Republican Senator Ron Johnson

00:05:44.501 --> 00:05:47.367
said that he is not sure
if he will accept the results

00:05:47.367 --> 00:05:49.501
of next week's
midterm elections, and added,

00:05:49.501 --> 00:05:52.400
"Do Democrats have something
up their sleeves?"

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.300
Have you met Democrats?

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:57.200
They famously have nothing
up their sleeve.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.033 --> 00:05:59.467
The best they can manage is

00:05:59.467 --> 00:06:01.300
a quarter behind the ear.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:04.767
According to a new poll,

00:06:04.767 --> 00:06:07.033
just 10% of voters
under the age of 40

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.801
strongly approve
of President Biden,

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.501
but mostly because people
under 40

00:06:10.501 --> 00:06:12.634
don't really feel
strongly anymore.

00:06:12.634 --> 00:06:14.501
[ Laughter ]
Dave, your house is on fire!

00:06:14.501 --> 00:06:16.000
"Alright, man, I don't know."

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.334 --> 00:06:19.300
Agriculture
Secretary Tom Vilsack

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.601
told reporters yesterday
that the country is facing

00:06:21.601 --> 00:06:23.567
a turkey shortage.
Oh, no!

00:06:23.567 --> 00:06:25.334
You mean we might not get
to have

00:06:25.334 --> 00:06:28.934
the world's driest meat
this Thanksgiving?

00:06:28.934 --> 00:06:32.701
What's next, a shortage on the
raisins that ruin stuffing?

00:06:32.701 --> 00:06:34.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:38.334
Under a new pay transparency law
that took effect yesterday,

00:06:38.334 --> 00:06:40.567
New York City employers
are now required

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:43.200
to disclose salary ranges
in all job listings,

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.400
which was a humiliating way

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.968
to find out Wally makes more
than me.

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:51.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:51.267 --> 00:06:53.133
A fire broke out early yesterday

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.133
at New York City's
Museum of Natural History

00:06:55.133 --> 00:06:56.701
and took about an hour
to contain.

00:06:56.701 --> 00:06:59.267
It took so long because none
of the rescue personnel

00:06:59.267 --> 00:07:01.734
could figure out where they were
on the free map.

00:07:01.734 --> 00:07:05.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:05.701 --> 00:07:08.868
Starbucks will begin offering
its holiday drink cups tomorrow.

00:07:08.868 --> 00:07:10.934
That story again --
tomorrow marks the start

00:07:10.934 --> 00:07:12.100
of the war on Christmas.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.400
"Plain red?!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.567
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:17.601
Do Jesus and Santa know
about this?!"

00:07:17.601 --> 00:07:18.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:18.667 --> 00:07:20.234
And, finally,
according to new reports,

00:07:20.234 --> 00:07:23.100
staff morale at CNN is
at an all-time low

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:25.634
as the network undergoes
a cost-cutting overhaul.

00:07:25.634 --> 00:07:28.868
In related news, get ready
for the new season of...

00:07:30.901 --> 00:07:32.534
[ Laughter ]

00:07:32.534 --> 00:07:35.033
President Biden spoke last night
about the upcoming

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:38.133
midterm elections and said,
quote, "In our bones,

00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:40.167
we know democracy is at risk."

00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:44.567
And you know the president is
old when he gets his best intel

00:07:44.567 --> 00:07:46.667
from his bones.

00:07:46.667 --> 00:07:50.501
Ah, knee's acting up,
I feel a veto coming on.

00:07:50.501 --> 00:07:53.167
President Biden urged voters
in his speech last night

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:56.567
to stand up for democracy and
said that Americans don't settle

00:07:56.567 --> 00:07:59.234
political differences, quote,
"With a riot or a mob

00:07:59.234 --> 00:08:00.434
or a bullet or a hammer."

00:08:00.434 --> 00:08:01.701
We don't?

00:08:01.701 --> 00:08:06.334
Because if not,
that's a weirdly specific list.

00:08:06.334 --> 00:08:08.267
That's like if your wife asked
if you were cheating

00:08:08.267 --> 00:08:10.334
and you said, "I don't even
think Rebecca's that sexy,

00:08:10.334 --> 00:08:11.901
and I certainly wouldn't meet up
with her

00:08:11.901 --> 00:08:13.868
at the Hotel Radisson Airport."

00:08:16.934 --> 00:08:19.334
I put all the word
in a different order.

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.834
I wanted to see if it worked,
if you put them all

00:08:22.834 --> 00:08:24.234
in a different word.

00:08:25.234 --> 00:08:26.400
That's how you say it, right?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.100
The Hotel Radisson Airport.

00:08:31.567 --> 00:08:35.801
Alex -- he's our director --
can you just cut it up

00:08:35.801 --> 00:08:39.033
and move all the words around
in post?

00:08:42.767 --> 00:08:45.334
Problem solved. [ Laughs ]

00:08:45.334 --> 00:08:48.033
In a new interview, Georgia
Senate candidate Herschel Walker

00:08:48.033 --> 00:08:49.467
said that he has a better résumé

00:08:49.467 --> 00:08:51.200
than Former President
Barack Obama.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:56.234
Really? It's better than
Former President Barack Obama?

00:08:56.234 --> 00:09:01.234
The only thing your résumé has
that his doesn't is typos.

00:09:01.234 --> 00:09:03.934
CNN released a new poll
yesterday that suggests

00:09:03.934 --> 00:09:06.467
Democrats may be facing
an enthusiasm problem

00:09:06.467 --> 00:09:08.200
ahead of next week's
midterm elections,

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.400
which explains this here
sticker.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.434
Former President Trump is
reportedly considering

00:09:15.434 --> 00:09:17.834
the two-week stretch after
the midterm elections

00:09:17.834 --> 00:09:20.167
as a window to formally announce
he's running for president

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:21.200
in 2024.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.968
Oh, right before Thanksgiving?
Awesome.

00:09:23.968 --> 00:09:27.033
Are you also gonna announce
that Aunt Lisa and her friend

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:28.467
aren't just roommates?

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:36.467
Elon Musk tweeted yesterday,
quote...

00:09:36.467 --> 00:09:40.968
For instance, it could mean
you're the president.

00:09:40.968 --> 00:09:44.033
SpaceX this week launched
its Falcon Heavy,

00:09:44.033 --> 00:09:45.968
which is the most powerful
rocket in the world,

00:09:45.968 --> 00:09:49.000
but I don't know how safe it is,
considering SpaceX is, I guess,

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.267
Elon Musk's third priority.

00:09:52.267 --> 00:09:56.667
Who starts a space program
in their spare time?

00:09:56.667 --> 00:09:58.968
NASCAR driver Ross Chastain
qualified

00:09:58.968 --> 00:10:00.767
for a championship race
over the weekend

00:10:00.767 --> 00:10:03.267
after performing
a wall-riding maneuver

00:10:03.267 --> 00:10:05.901
that he claimed to have learned
from a Nintendo GameCube

00:10:05.901 --> 00:10:07.601
video game as a child.

00:10:07.601 --> 00:10:10.167
Even crazier, Denny Hamlin moved
into fifth place

00:10:10.167 --> 00:10:14.634
after throwing a red shell
at the driver in front of him.

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:20.133
Two chefs in Boston recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:10:20.133 --> 00:10:23.934
by assembling a sushi roll
that was over seven feet wide.

00:10:23.934 --> 00:10:25.701
Now for the sad news.

00:10:25.701 --> 00:10:31.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:31.701 --> 00:10:33.434
We realized the real problem
with that joke

00:10:33.434 --> 00:10:35.234
is Shamu died like 20 years ago,
right?

00:10:35.234 --> 00:10:36.601
[ Laughter ]

00:10:36.601 --> 00:10:38.667
Don't eat other sushi.

00:10:42.234 --> 00:10:44.968
And finally Dunkin' Donuts is
now offering its holiday menu

00:10:44.968 --> 00:10:47.434
which includes a pancake
Wake-Up Wrap

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:49.267
that's filled with eggs,
American cheese,

00:10:49.267 --> 00:10:50.634
and sausage or bacon.

00:10:50.634 --> 00:10:53.067
The part they don't tell you is
where you'll wake up.

00:10:53.067 --> 00:10:56.334
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:10:56.334 --> 00:11:00.801
♪♪

